# Public base URL baked into every QR / barcode link (farmer, processor, warehouse, roaster,
# cafe stickers + product detail QR). Set this once the app is deployed on a VPS/domain so
# every QR code points at the real address, e.g.:
#
#   VITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://sangrai.yourdomain.com
#
# Leave this unset/commented to auto-detect from the browser's own origin instead — that
# already works correctly for most deployments (the app just uses whatever domain it's
# actually being served from). Only set this if you're behind a reverse proxy / CDN where the
# public address differs from window.location.origin.
# VITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://sangrai.yourdomain.com
